convertHarvest
├── When unauthorized, paused, expired or invalid leg/bucket/amount/cap
│   └── It reverts
├── When custody is deficient or venue consumes/reports an unexpected delta
│   └── It atomically restores classified carry
├── When output misses minimum
│   └── It atomically reverts
└── When either leg and either bucket succeeds, including unrelated token outage
    └── It converts carry only and clears approval without a second reward split
